## Baseline (before any changes)

`python3 -m unittest test_reportgen` → exit 0:

```
..........
----------------------------------------------------------------------
Ran 12 tests in 0.220s

OK
```
(with two `ResourceWarning: unclosed file` warnings from the shipped test itself)

